<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month bill yield falls to 20.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month bill yield falls to 20.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.73 percent, down from 20.12 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	4,331.97 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.73 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.5090 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
